  "description": "<p><span style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(227, 227, 227);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:none;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(23, 23, 23);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-family:'Google Sans Flex, Google Sans, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif'\" class=\"query-text-line ng-star-inserted\">The scene features a road through the woods and the scene of an accident in which a person was hit by a wagon.  It works well as an encounter - whether your players stumbled upon the scene or the ones responsible. </span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(227, 227, 227);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:none;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(23, 23, 23);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-family:'Google Sans Flex, Google Sans, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif'\" class=\"query-text-line ng-star-inserted\">The map also features a version without the roadkill, which turns it into just a road in the woods with a couple of places of interest.</span></p><p><span style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(227, 227, 227);font-size:17px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:none;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(23, 23, 23);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;font-family:'Google Sans Flex, Google Sans, Helvetica Neue, sans-serif'\" class=\"query-text-line ng-star-inserted\">The map also includes a small camp, a roadside shrine and a fairy circle.</span></p>",
